translate kr qst_DaughterOfMetal_02_40a70433:

    # ARLENA "So, it's fine for everyone else to starve, just as long as you two pricks don't, right?"
    ARLENA "그러니까, 너희 이 두 놈만 굶지 않으면 다른 사람들은 굶어도 괜찮다는 거지?"

