translate kr qst_DaughterOfMetal_02_2_84f2a075:

    # ARLENA "... Mmm... Excuse me one moment, kind sir, I think I need to find a bucket."
    ARLENA "... 으음... 잠시 실례할게요, 친절한 신사분, 양동이를 좀 찾아야 할 것 같아서요."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DaughterOfMetal/scr_02.rpy:193
translate kr qst_DaughterOfMetal_02_2_50e688cf:

    # "Arlena lurched towards one of the rooms where she slammed the door behind her."
    "아를레나는 방 하나를 향해 휘청거리며 가서, 등 뒤로 문을 쾅 닫았다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DaughterOfMetal/scr_02.rpy:194
translate kr qst_DaughterOfMetal_02_2_8800a557:

