    "조용히, 나는 대장간을 나서며 등 뒤로 문을 닫았다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DaughterOfMetal/scr_02.rpy:200
translate kr qst_DaughterOfMetal_02_2_9a1158f6:

    # "Taking off my shirt, Arlena's eyes widened as she flushed pink at the sight of me."
